<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--The following translations were generated by https://www.deepl.com/-->
  <!-- EN: stealthy -->
  <SYR_Agile.degreeDatas.stealthy.label>隐蔽的</SYR_Agile.degreeDatas.stealthy.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is uncommonly agile and stealthy, with better reflexes and a more flexible body than most. -->
  <SYR_Agile.degreeDatas.stealthy.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 身手异常敏捷且擅长潜行，其反应速度和身体柔韧性都优于常人。</SYR_Agile.degreeDatas.stealthy.description>
  <!-- EN: animal friend -->
  <SYR_AnimalAffinity.degreeDatas.animal_friend.label>动物伙伴</SYR_AnimalAffinity.degreeDatas.animal_friend.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has a special connection to animals and understands them better than most people. Animals also tend to understand what {PAWN_pronoun} wants from them. The time {PAWN_pronoun} spends with animals is long, but worth it.\n\n    Taming never causes manhunter\n    Easier taming of very wild animals -->
  <SYR_AnimalAffinity.degreeDatas.animal_friend.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 与动物有着特殊的羁绊，比大多数人更懂得它们。动物也往往能理解 {PAWN_pronoun} 对它们的期望。{PAWN_pronoun} 与动物相处的时间虽长，但非常值得。

    驯服绝不会触发“猎人”事件
    更容易驯服极度野性的动物</SYR_AnimalAffinity.degreeDatas.animal_friend.description>
  <!-- EN: architect -->
  <SYR_Architect.degreeDatas.architect.label>建筑师</SYR_Architect.degreeDatas.architect.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is proficient with various construction materials, particularly stone. {PAWN_pronoun} will construct anything out of stone three times as fast as others and smooth out your rocky base in no time.\n\n    Stone construction speed +200% -->
  <SYR_Architect.degreeDatas.architect.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 擅长使用各种建筑材料，尤其是石头。{PAWN_pronoun} 用石头建造任何东西的速度是其他人的三倍，能迅速将你那崎岖不平的基地修整平整。

 石头建造速度  200%</SYR_Architect.degreeDatas.architect.description>
  <!-- EN: creative thinker -->
  <SYR_CreativeThinker.degreeDatas.creative_thinker.label>富有创造力的思考者</SYR_CreativeThinker.degreeDatas.creative_thinker.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has a unique approach to science. {PAWN_pronoun} always thinks outside the box and finds inspiration for intellectual problems in art.\n\n    Artistic increases research speed -->
  <SYR_CreativeThinker.degreeDatas.creative_thinker.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 对科学有着独特的研究方法。{PAWN_pronoun} 总是跳出思维定势，并从艺术中汲取解决智力问题的灵感。

 艺术天赋可提升研究速度</SYR_CreativeThinker.degreeDatas.creative_thinker.description>
  <!-- EN: fortunate -->
  <SYR_GoodFortune.degreeDatas.fortunate.label>幸运</SYR_GoodFortune.degreeDatas.fortunate.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} seems to have rented all the good fortune on this Rimworld. -->
  <SYR_GoodFortune.degreeDatas.fortunate.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 似乎包揽了这个 Rimworld 上所有的好运。</SYR_GoodFortune.degreeDatas.fortunate.description>
  <!-- EN: green thumb -->
  <SYR_GreenThumb.degreeDatas.green_thumb.label>绿拇指</SYR_GreenThumb.degreeDatas.green_thumb.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has a special talent to grow plants and nurture them even in hostile enviroments. {PAWN_pronoun} can grow any plant, even if other people would fail due to their lack of skills. {PAWN_pronoun} would like some plants in {PAWN_possessive} bedroom.\n\n    Can grow any plant regardless of skill -->
  <SYR_GreenThumb.degreeDatas.green_thumb.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 拥有一项特殊天赋，即使在恶劣的环境中也能种植和培育植物。{PAWN_pronoun} 可以种植任何植物，即使其他人因技能不足而无法成功。{PAWN_pronoun} 希望在 {PAWN_possessive} 的卧室里摆放一些植物。

    无论技能高低，都能种植任何植物</SYR_GreenThumb.degreeDatas.green_thumb.description>
  <!-- EN: gun nut -->
  <SYR_GunNut.degreeDatas.gun_nut.label>枪械迷</SYR_GunNut.degreeDatas.gun_nut.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is a gun nut, {PAWN_possessive} life revolves around guns, how they are crafted, maintained and used. Quite a handy skill in these circumstances. Just don't hand {PAWN_objective} a melee weapon. -->
  <SYR_GunNut.degreeDatas.gun_nut.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 是个枪械迷，{PAWN_possessive} 的生活围绕着枪支展开，包括如何制作、保养和使用枪支。在这种情况下，这可是一项相当实用的技能。只是千万别把近战武器交给 {PAWN_objective}。</SYR_GunNut.degreeDatas.gun_nut.description>
  <!-- EN: silver tongue -->
  <SYR_Haggler.degreeDatas.silver_tongue.label>巧舌如簧</SYR_Haggler.degreeDatas.silver_tongue.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} knows exactly the right words for every situation. This also means {PAWN_possessive} insults hurt more. -->
  <SYR_Haggler.degreeDatas.silver_tongue.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 总能针对各种情况说出恰到好处的话。这也意味着 {PAWN_possessive} 的侮辱会更让人难受。</SYR_Haggler.degreeDatas.silver_tongue.description>
  <!-- EN: hand-eye coordination -->
  <SYR_HandEyeCoordination.degreeDatas.handeye_coordination.label>手眼协调能力</SYR_HandEyeCoordination.degreeDatas.handeye_coordination.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is exceptionally coordinated with his hands. -->
  <SYR_HandEyeCoordination.degreeDatas.handeye_coordination.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 的手部协调能力极佳。</SYR_HandEyeCoordination.degreeDatas.handeye_coordination.description>
  <!-- EN: keen eye -->
  <SYR_KeenEye.degreeDatas.keen_eye.label>敏锐的目光</SYR_KeenEye.degreeDatas.keen_eye.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has a keen eye and can spot even tiny mineral deposits. {PAWN_pronoun} will occassionally find small clumps of resources when mining any sort of stone or ore. Chance increased for flatter terrain. -->
  <SYR_KeenEye.degreeDatas.keen_eye.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 眼力极佳，连微小的矿脉都能发现。{PAWN_pronoun} 在开采任何类型的石头或矿石时，偶尔会发现小块的资源。在地势平坦的地方，发现几率会更高。</SYR_KeenEye.degreeDatas.keen_eye.description>
  <!-- EN: mechanoid expert -->
  <SYR_MechanoidExpert.degreeDatas.mechanoid_expert.label>机械人专家</SYR_MechanoidExpert.degreeDatas.mechanoid_expert.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has had their fair share of encounters with mechanoids. {PAWN_pronoun} has become an expert in mechanoid construction and combat, making {PAWN_objective} uniquely suited to disassemble and fight them.\n\n    Damage versus mechanoids +50% -->
  <SYR_MechanoidExpert.degreeDatas.mechanoid_expert.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 曾多次与机械生物交手。{PAWN_pronoun} 已成为机械生物制造与战斗方面的专家，这使得 {PAWN_objective} 特别擅长拆解和对抗它们。

 对机械生物造成的伤害  50%</SYR_MechanoidExpert.degreeDatas.mechanoid_expert.description>
  <!-- EN: perfectionist -->
  <SYR_Perfectionist.degreeDatas.perfectionist.label>完美主义者</SYR_Perfectionist.degreeDatas.perfectionist.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} wants thing to be exactly right. This does take time, but the results speak for themselves.\n\n    Quality level +1 (50% chance) -->
  <SYR_Perfectionist.degreeDatas.perfectionist.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 希望一切都做到尽善尽美。虽然这确实需要时间，但结果不言自明。

 质量等级  1（50% 的概率）</SYR_Perfectionist.degreeDatas.perfectionist.description>
  <!-- EN: steady hands -->
  <SYR_SteadyHands.degreeDatas.steady_hands.label>稳稳的手</SYR_SteadyHands.degreeDatas.steady_hands.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has particularly steady hands, which don't even tremble in dire circumstances or when {PAWN_pronoun} {PAWN_objective}self is injured.\n\n    No self-tend penalty -->
  <SYR_SteadyHands.degreeDatas.steady_hands.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 手特别稳，即使在危急关头或 {PAWN_pronoun} {PAWN_objective} 自身受伤时，双手也不会颤抖。

 无自我治疗惩罚</SYR_SteadyHands.degreeDatas.steady_hands.description>
  <!-- EN: strong back -->
  <SYR_StrongBack.degreeDatas.strong_back.label>强健的背部</SYR_StrongBack.degreeDatas.strong_back.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has a very strong back or is part mule or something. {PAWN_pronoun} can carry significantly more as a normal person. -->
  <SYR_StrongBack.degreeDatas.strong_back.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 背部非常强壮，或者说有骡子的血统之类的。{PAWN_pronoun} 能比普通人多扛很多东西。</SYR_StrongBack.degreeDatas.strong_back.description>
</LanguageData>